tooltip_text = "[title]Help[/title]
The following controls are available:

[ul]
UP, DOWN, LEFT, RIGHT: Hold any of these keys to preview the character’s walking animation in the corresponding direction.
SPACE: Displays the attack animation of the currently equipped weapon.
Mouse Wheel (Up/Down): Zoom in or out on the character preview in the editor.
Right Mouse Button (Parts tab): Toggle the visibility of any layer in the editor (costumes are saved with hidden layers set to \"none\").
Middle Mouse Button (Parts tab): Set the selected part to \"none\".
[/ul]"
